On /e/OS, /e/ Camera's prebuilt module lists Aperture in its overrides,
so Aperture, which vendor/lineage's common_mobile_full.mk adds to
PRODUCT_PACKAGES, is dropped from the build. On doha /e/ Camera (an
Open Camera 1.55 fork) gets the preview shape wrong for the ultra-wide
action camera (camera 3, sensor orientation 0); stock Open Camera 1.56.2
has the same bug. Aperture handles it correctly. Drop Aperture from the
overrides so both apps install. Camera2 and Snap stay overridden.

diff --git a/Camera/Android.bp b/Camera/Android.bp
index 2d36835..5c78847 100644
--- a/Camera/Android.bp
+++ b/Camera/Android.bp
@@ -4,7 +4,6 @@ android_app_import {
     overrides: [
         "Camera2",
         "Snap",
-        "Aperture",
     ],
     arch: {
         arm: {
